  "id": "goal-directed-behavior",
  "term": "goal-directed behavior",
  "definition": "Goal-directed behavior is behavior aimed at carrying out intended tasks or objectives, especially in everyday situations. In assessment, it refers to how well a person can complete purposeful activities in realistic contexts, such as following instructions to do household chores.",
